    "y": [
     "count"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "Overdue Loans",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Loan ID\", \"Disbursement Date\", \"SHG Name\", \"Loan Amount (Rs)\" FROM shg_loan_register WHERE \"Repayment Status\" = 'Overdue'"
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "This report provides a snapshot of the SHG loan register. The total number of loans disbursed is {{p1}}. A significant portion of these loans are either closed or overdue, as shown in the repayment status distribution pie chart. The bar chart illustrates the distribution of loans across different purposes, with {{p3.1}} being the most common. Finally, the table lists the overdue loans, providing details such as loan ID, disbursement date, SHG name, and loan amount. Further investigation into the reasons for overdue loans could inform strategies for improved repayment rates."
